### Test root route
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### Get one product (existing)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### Get one product (not exist)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/999

### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Webcam",
  "price": 79.99,
  "quantity": 3
}

### Create with missing field (should fail with 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken product"
}

### Update a product (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 59.99
}

### Update non-existent product (should fail with 404)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1
}

### Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/2

### Delete non-existent (should fail with 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/999

### Get all products to confirm changes
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### Filter products by name
GET http://localhost:3000/products?name=key

### Sort products by price (ascending)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=price

### Sort products by price (descending)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=-price

### Combine filter + sort
GET http://localhost:3000/products?name=o&sort=-price

### Test 404 handler (route that doesn't exist)
GET http://localhost:3000/nonexistent